  "id": "orc",
  "name": "Orc war-town",
  "faction": "Horde",
  "status": "approved",
  "note": "2026-10-30 the owner asked for every race planned so far to be completed (\"get all the races planned thus far complete\"): the core set delivered whole and town_rules/orc.json written, so the race founds towns.",
  "concept": {
    "setting": "an orc war-town in a red rock canyon desert under a hot orange sky",
    "buildings": "round and oval huts on low red sandstone and terracotta walls, roofs of stretched brown and tan hides over curved timber ribs, great curved tusk-like timbers and iron spikes jutting from every roof ridge and doorway, rusted iron plates bolted over the walls, bone and skull ornaments, heavy log palisades with sharpened tops",
    "landmark": "a towering great hall fortress on a rock outcrop: tiers of spiked hide-and-timber roofs over thick red stone walls, giant curved tusks framing its gate, smoke rising from braziers on every tier",
    "street_life": "fire braziers and torches along the paths, war drums on wooden stands, weapon racks and training dummies, tanning racks with drying hides, a wolf kennel with gnawed bones, cookfire spits, spiky wagons at a dusty market",
    "greenery": "sparse and harsh: thorny scrub, dry yellow grass, twisted dead trees, barrel cactus, a muddy oasis pool with reeds",
    "materials": "red sandstone, orange, red and brown terracotta, acacia and dark oak logs, brown and orange wool for hides, iron bars and chains, bone blocks, campfires, lanterns",
    "colours": [
      "rust red",
      "burnt orange",
      "tan hide",
      "charred black",
      "bone white"
    ],
    "avoid": [
      "neat rectangular houses",
      "glass windows",
      "pastel colours"
    ],
    "ground": "red sand and orange terracotta desert ground with a few dry bushes"
  },
